== one number, several spellings ==
  all the same: true
  as hex:       FF
  as binary:    11111111
  and back:     255, 255
  a million:    true
  1.5e3:        1500
  2.5e-3:       0.0025
  1e3 is real:  true
7 as a real is 7, as a fraction 7|1
a third as a real is 0.3333333333333333
a tenth as a fraction is 3602879701896397|36028797018963968
and as text: 1|3 0.1
letters: {'c', 'a', 's', 't', 's'}
word:    cast, now 5 letters
spelled: 5 letters
nothing stays nothing: true
a circle of radius 2
a square, which has no radius to read
a circle of radius 0.5
Hearts is number 2
1 names Diamonds
2 names Hearts
3 names Spades
4 names no suit
